Pipes |&gt;
The pipe passes the result on the left into the next function, so you can chain verbs into a readable recipe:

penguins |&gt;
    select(species, island, sex, body_mass_g, bill_length_mm) |&gt;
    mutate(body_mass_kg = body_mass_g / 1000) |&gt;
    filter(sex == "female") |&gt;
    arrange(bill_length_mm) |&gt;
    select(-body_mass_g)




